# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# dependencies
/node_modules
/.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions

# testing
/coverage

# next.js
/.next/
# 靜態匯出輸出目錄（由 GitHub Actions 重新產生，不進版控）
/out/

# production
/build

# misc
.DS_Store
*.pem

# debug
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# env files (can opt-in for committing if needed)
.env*
# 範本檔可 commit，作為部署對照（實際數值放 .env.local / GitHub Actions Variables）
!.env.example

# vercel
.vercel

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# 舊架構（PGlite / Drizzle）殘留的本機資料，確認不需要後可自行刪除
/.pgdata
/.pgdata.*
/drizzle
